mone dieselbe Vial-, Konzentrations- und Injektionslogik ohne Codeduplikat nutzen."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_07_21_my_stack_foundation_design_stackitemwizard", "label": "StackItemWizard", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-21-my-stack-foundation-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_07_21_my_stack_foundation_design_duplicate_fingerprint", "label": "Duplikat-Fingerprint", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-21-my-stack-foundation-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Aus Inhaltsstoffen, Form und Staerke wird ein normalisierter Vergleichsschluessel gebildet; es gibt bewusst keine harte Datenbank-Eindeutigkeit, weil reale parallele Varianten erlaubt bleiben muessen."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_07_21_my_stack_foundation_design_migrations_gate", "label": "Backup- und Migrations-Gate", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-21-my-stack-foundation-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_07_21_my_stack_foundation_design_needs_review", "label": "configuration_status needs_review", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-21-my-stack-foundation-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Migrierte Eintraege ohne eindeutige Staerke oder Form werden markiert statt Werte zu erfinden; die Bestaetigung wird erst bei der naechsten Bearbeitung verlangt."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_07_21_my_stack_foundation_design_stackstage", "label": "StackStage Renderer-Schnittstelle", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-21-my-stack-foundation-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Eine Form wird erst im grafischen Karussell freigeschaltet, wenn ihr Renderer die Qualitaet des bestehenden Vials erreicht; keine minderwertigen Zwischen-Icons."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_07_21_my_stack_foundation_design_transaktionale_speicherung", "label": "Transaktionale atomare Speicherung", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-21-my-stack-foundation-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_07_21_my_stack_foundation_design_color_hex_persistenz", "label": "Farbpersistenz in color_hex statt localStorage", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-21-my-stack-foundation-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_07_21_my_stack_foundation_design_mystackpage", "label": "MyStackPage", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-21-my-stack-foundation-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_07_21_my_stack_foundation_design_kompletter_umbau", "label": "Sauberer Komplettumbau statt Kompatibilitaetsschichten", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-21-my-stack-foundation-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Die App ist noch nicht veroeffentlicht und hat einen Nutzer; deshalb wird jetzt umbenannt statt die peptidspezifische Benennung dauerhaft mitzuschleppen."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_07_21_my_stack_foundation_design_stack_